# Force LF line endings for all text files regardless of platform/autocrlf
# settings. This repo has no binary assets, and scripts/templates rendered
# or executed by bash/zsh/fish/PowerShell all tolerate LF; CRLF creeping in
# via a Windows checkout breaks bash parsing (e.g. inside Docker test
# containers) and diffs noisily.
* text=auto eol=lf
